# Switch Email Service to HTTP Gmail REST API

## Problem & Context
Render blocks outbound SMTP traffic on ports `25`, `465`, and `587` on standard/free plans to prevent spam abuse. Attempting to connect to `smtp.gmail.com:587` or `465` from Render results in connection timeouts (`ETIMEDOUT`).

To resolve this, we will migrate the email sending pipeline in PropPulse CRM from traditional SMTP to Google's **Gmail REST HTTP API** (`POST https://gmail.googleapis.com/gmail/v1/users/me/messages/send`), communicating over standard HTTPS (port 443).

