### Communication Feature Layer

#### [MODIFY] [email.provider.ts](file:///c:/Users/lenovo/OneDrive/Desktop/Real%20estate%20CRM/real-estate-crm/server/src/features/communication/providers/email.provider.ts)
- Introduce a high-performance HTTP Gmail API delivery engine:
  - Automatic OAuth2 token exchange with caching: caches `access_token` until expiry to eliminate redundant token requests.
  - RFC 2822 MIME generation using `nodemailer/lib/mail-composer` (preserves all formatting, HTML, text, and UTF-8 encoding).
  - Safe `base64url` payload encoding.
  - `POST https://gmail.googleapis.com/gmail/v1/users/me/messages/send` via Node native `fetch` over HTTPS (port 443).
- Graceful priority hierarchy:
  1. **Gmail REST HTTP API** (if `GMAIL_CLIENT_ID`, `GMAIL_CLIENT_SECRET`, `GMAIL_REFRESH_TOKEN` are present) — Render & Cloud Production Ready.
  2. **SMTP Transport** (if `SMTP_HOST`, `SMTP_USER`, `SMTP_PASS` are present) — local/legacy compatibility.
  3. **Ethereal Email Sandbox** — zero-card local development mode.

